{"seq":17,"time":"2026-11-25T22:34:11Z","prev":"a53105ac80384e953028f30f6889b9f27dd038de491e4b40dfe90909949011fa","type":"finding.fix-confirmed","more":1,"data":{"evidence":"Re-ran the finding's reproduction on the fixed candidate: after upserts at 100 €, 90 € and 90 € again the history is 100.00, 90.00; a watcher update to 85 € appends 85.00; get_listing keeps the original id and first_seen_at; delete_listing still removes the listing and its history. The fixture suite passes.","id":"F-0001","packet":"P-0003","scope":"proportionate","scope_evidence":"One commit; in listings/store.py it changes only upsert_listing's write, which is what the finding needs."},"hash":"a8fc74f036b71b25e4165c2b7741057e79e96cf8b7e02812c8d67dcfa4f9527f"}
