{"seq":22,"time":"2026-11-25T22:37:53Z","prev":"181301d6e1b5a453a8026fa1119b3f2f224cd6281a496c7f3c4fa6339795498c","type":"report.accepted","more":2,"data":{"author":{"harness":"omp 19.1.1","id":"reviewer-1","kind":"agent","model":"qwen3.7-plus"},"digest":"sha256:b40cf9621633d3b32daa97813c691b5e03d5f14c27878ac4abe709020ef6469b","packet":"P-0004","provenance":{"mode":"declared"},"raw_digest":"sha256:6df1f0eb5a831c1a1e18a5b99291cf20d45932d2872e9423ae2ef0d5450da226","role":"reviewer"},"hash":"4877304f0490ed21e887c0279563c8b3d7aba299bf5c7499b938434bba8c2c2c"}
{"seq":23,"time":"2026-11-25T22:37:53Z","prev":"4877304f0490ed21e887c0279563c8b3d7aba299bf5c7499b938434bba8c2c2c","type":"finding.reopened","more":1,"data":{"id":"F-0001","justification":"Commit 81b9530 replaced the separate UPDATE/INSERT with a single INSERT OR REPLACE. INSERT OR REPLACE on a UNIQUE conflict deletes the existing row, triggering ON DELETE CASCADE on price_history, which wipes the history. Reproduction on this candidate confirms: after 3 upserts (100€, 90€, 90€), price_history returns 0 rows. The fix from ba8487a is no longer in effect. The existing test test_rescrape_with_a_new_price_sets_the_current_price only checks price_minor, not price_history, so it does not catch the regression.","packet":"P-0004","reason":"regression","root_cause_required":false},"hash":"31334c24e696ff3320d61d4a1c3c01907f2e08694eda4e6e6eb54ee0e04da9f3"}
